# Prose/governance documents are out of scope for a code formatter: ADRs are
# immutable once accepted, the constitution has its own amendment procedure,
# and spec-kit's own scaffolding predates this feature. Reformatting any of
# these as a side effect of `pnpm format` would be unreviewed, unrequested
# churn on documents this feature doesn't own.
*.md
.claude/
.specify/
adr/
**/src/generated/

# The design canvas artboards are generated, not hand-written: `design/*.dc.html`
# and `canvas.json` are emitted by the seed pipeline and re-emitted in full on
# every change, so formatting them here would desync them from their generator
# and produce a diff on every regeneration. Prettier's HTML formatter also
# introduces line breaks between inline elements, and a whitespace text node
# inside a flex container is a layout change, not a cosmetic one.
design/
